46108.062700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X7RT6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4a208dd-c1c7-44d0-81a2-e4915ea89790","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"よく見たらスクショもasdfのエラーだった（つまり上で見てたコードはまったく関係なかった）","ts":"1635146054.062300","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1635146070.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BeuHD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17d8eb98-451a-4f3e-970f-835b9bf59d36","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あーなるほど、だから `exit 2` が返ってきて失敗するのか","ts":"1635146034.061900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lQG7j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47de64af-1041-494a-aa0b-0e35e0dcdfa7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"あーすいません。私の環境なんですが、正確には `asdf` で `deno` を入れており、`deno` コマンド自体は存在している(asdf がラッパを作る)けど、指定されたバージョンの deno が裏に存在していないので `deno` コマンドが失敗する、と言う状況でした","ts":"1635145996.061500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e7JI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c195cec4-67e7-4c03-a94e-3b3ba8d0b5f0","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/blob/ee870b82e28d5bf713808c1328f5d8b2b672c1a1/autoload/denops/server.vim#L107-L117\u003e\njobのon_exitをフックしてこれが走ってるけど、じゃあなぜon_exitが走るのかが分からない\nここをうまく抑制できればよさそうなんですが","ts":"1635144419.059800","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/blob/ee870b82e28d5bf713808c1328f5d8b2b672c1a1/autoload/denops/server.vim | server.vim\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim/blob/ee870b82e28d5bf713808c1328f5d8b2b672c1a1/autoload/denops/server.vim | server.vim\u003e","text":"```\nfunction! s:on_exit(status, ...) abort dict\n  let s:job = v:null\n  let s:chan = v:null\n  call denops#util#debug(printf('Server stopped: %s', a:status))\n  doautocmd \u0026lt;nomodeline\u0026gt; User DenopsStopped\n  if s:stopped_on_purpose || v:dying || v:exiting || s:vim_exiting\n    return\n  endif\n  \" Restart asynchronously to avoid #136\n  call timer_start(g:denops#server#restart_delay, { -\u0026gt; s:restart(a:status) })\nendfunction\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim-denops/denops.vim|vim-denops/denops.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZLmwM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e465967-1867-477a-b5c8-f5dd03478c80","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"どこが発火してるかは分かったけど、なんでこれが呼び出されるのかは分からない……","ts":"1635144176.058400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LgIx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ff2fa96-53df-4cb0-809d-af62639811b9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"これどこから出てるのかわからないので私には修正不能です","ts":"1635143927.057900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kyLwW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7866501-684e-4036-80bd-ccd278aa3803","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そのメッセージがソースコードにないんですよ","ts":"1635143904.057100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"++b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"82aa5231-7609-4b7a-87aa-89be49d27ab5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"deno コマンドがインストールされていれば問題は起きないので特に困っていない","ts":"1635143537.056600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N5dB5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b4b3da6b-7c9c-451e-a76a-7847478fcbe5","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私は直す気ないですよ","ts":"1635143467.055900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"block