-b14a-cf12b09906f5","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"galaxylineでskkeletonの状態を出すのに、各モードの文字列と実際に表示させたい文字列をテーブルで定義してたんですよね\n添字のところに `skkeleton#mode` の文字列をそのまま入れようとしたら空文字列が入ってコケた、と\nVimのdictだったら上手くいくのだろうか","ts":"1635131715.040500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7tkbE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5bd9cee1-6111-4124-9111-780b13daa5dc","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Luaの考慮は特にするつもりはないです、コンテキストで型が変わる方が害がある","ts":"1635131657.039600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cru"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9ce5f91-6a16-491e-9a57-cc76ec719941","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"はい、見ての通りそのまま使うのは想定してないですね","ts":"1635131611.037800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w2YP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19ca5059-9132-4e33-a6f1-770f59273674","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そもそも何がしたいのかよくわからなかった。私は特に困ってない","ts":"1635131579.036800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pV=Jv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f950990a-831f-4553-8042-ab5d537becd1","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"luaの空文字列はtruthyな事を知った","ts":"1635131477.036400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Xn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e452c49-c35e-4d05-9ec4-bf2e645cff5e","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"結局三項演算子でケアすることになった\nredrawstatusも併用していい感じにはなったけど","ts":"1635131415.035800","edited":{"user":"U01D44KSY9Z","ts":"1635131429.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dN+AM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6a664ae-f5f9-429c-bc2f-33c87e90521c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"redrawstatusはstatusline再描画するだけですね","ts":"1635131110.034900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EcUS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14e48537-343c-4bb3-b041-dab8c7a54874","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"空文字列である必然性もないがdisabledである必然性もないな、どうしたものか","ts":"1635131058.033900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aUO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a5eef02-8c11-45ed-92d0-2630349e5573","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"あ、redrawstatusってそういう意図のコマンドではないのか\nならもうちょいやりようがありそう","ts":"1635130979.033000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"91WNU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c3bcf35-e6ad-4c99-a12b-9d79ac2dfb59","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":":naruhodo:","ts":"1635127906.032500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U=b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"085deb56-f279-404e-9f39-d32811aebbed","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"オレオレ実装だとredrawstatusを使わずに自前の関数で空文字列だった場合に `disabled` という文字列を入れてます","ts":"1635127801.032300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C9K="}]},{"client_msg_id":"ba2e23d8-9235-437b-8dcd-63f3d148c864","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"理由というかそれに伴う副作用がないか、か","ts":"1635127718.031600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PYc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ca740b6-286c-4f9b-9ce7-df1d8947be8b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"skkeleton-mode-changedというイベントがあって、 `redrawstatus` というコマンドがあるんですけど、それがskkeletonの無効化時に空の文字列を返すようになってるんですよね\nたぶんdisabledになった時のモードが定義されてない（定義する合理的理由があるか、という問題になる）","ts":"1635127700.031200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FCNM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd3c324c-4ee2-4d31-a3de-71e5b286ebb6","type":"message","user":"U